# Files excluded from the Cloudflare static-asset upload (gitignore syntax).
#
# wrangler.toml serves the repository root ([assets] directory = "."), so any file in the build
# checkout that is not listed here becomes public. The served set is declared once, as PublicAssets
# in tests/Deployment.Contract.psd1; the local Pester suite fails when a file is neither public nor
# excluded. Rules:
#
# - New non-site file or directory: add it here.
# - New site file: add it to PublicAssets instead.
# - Keep entries explicit; do not use "!" negations (the suite rejects them).
#
# E2.1 replaces this with a dist/-only upload. Background: docs/deployment.md.

# Git metadata left by the Workers Builds checkout
.git

# Repository tooling and configuration
.assetsignore
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.vscode
cspell.json
dprint.json
wrangler.toml

# Repository documentation and tests
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE
README.md
docs
tests

# Local artifacts
*.log
*.swp
